            ('86', 'Voting', 'At every election, the Independent Electoral and Boundaries Commission shall ensure that whatever voting method is used, the system is simple, accurate, verifiable, secure, accountable and transparent. The Commission shall ensure that the votes cast are counted, tabulated and the results announced promptly by the presiding officer.'),
