            ('132', 'Functions of the President', 'The President shall address the opening of each newly elected Parliament, address a special sitting of Parliament once every year, and may address Parliament at any other time. The President shall nominate and appoint, with the approval of the National Assembly, Cabinet Secretaries and other State officers.'),
