            ('148', 'Election and swearing in of Deputy President', 'A candidate for Deputy President shall be nominated by each candidate for President. The Deputy President-elect shall be sworn in before the President-elect.'),
            ('149', 'Vacancy in the office of Deputy President', 'Within fourteen days of a vacancy in the office of Deputy President, the President shall nominate a person to fill the vacancy, subject to approval by the National Assembly.'),
