            ('154', 'Secretary to the Cabinet', 'There is established the office of the Secretary to the Cabinet, who is the chief executive officer of the Cabinet and shall be appointed by the President.'),
            ('155', 'Principal Secretaries', 'There is established the office of Principal Secretary, who is the administrative head of a State department. The President shall nominate a person for appointment as Principal Secretary, subject to approval by the National Assembly.'),
